  *
+ * RECOMP_PAD_AUTO=<period ms> gets a title from boot into play without a
+ * timeline: every period it presses START, and A half a period later, until
+ * frames have looked like gameplay (RECOMP_PAD_AUTO_DRAWS batches, default
